        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CRS100SWVSBR, Modern Bling Pull</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Acrylic Door Pull is filled with Austrian Crystals for a truly beautiful look. The picture really doesn't do the beauty of the sparkling Austrian Crystals justice. Choose from 12 inch, 18 inch, and 24 inch lengths in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading; this ultra clear acrylic allows the Austrian Crystals to show their shimmering beauty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omn-mortise-entrance-handleset.jpg?v=1704354592\" width=\"500\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Austrian Crystals Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Austrian Crystal Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Acrylic filled with Austrian Crystals</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL05-specifications.pdf?v=1704262300\"><b>First Impressions CRS100SWVSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CRS100012SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CRS100018SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CRS100024SWVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 22-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
