                "title": "Modern Acrylic Door Pull with Austrian Crystals",
                "description": "The Modern Acrylic Door Pull is filled with Austrian Crystals for a truly beautiful look. The picture really doesn't do the beauty of the sparkling Austrian Crystals justice. Choose from 12 inch, 18 inch, and 24 inch lengths in surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The acrylic is manufactured with UV inhibitors to prevent yellowing and fading; this ultra clear acrylic allows the Austrian Crystals to show their shimmering beauty.\r\n",
